      "title": "Identifying a gap between decarbonization needs and practical solar and wind deployment in ASEAN",
      "title_en": "Identifying a gap between decarbonization needs and practical solar and wind deployment in ASEAN",
      "title_zh": "识别东盟地区脱碳需求与太阳能和风能实际部署之间的差距",
      "link": "https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1748-9326/ae9e4b",
      "source": "Environmental Research Letters",
